Date:   Fri Oct 16 21:36:52 2026 +0900

    Add member loan history endpoint

    GET /members/{memberId}/loans/history returns every loan the member has
    ever had, returned or not, newest loan first. Each item carries the book
    title, loanedAt, returnedAt and lateFee. Unreturned loans have null
    returnedAt and lateFee. A member with no loans gets an empty array, and
    an unknown member gets 404.

    The existing /loans endpoint still lists only unreturned loans.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

